  "body": "Property docs: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/6NNA\r\nAuction: Thursday, 05 Nov, from 12:00pm at Harcourts Takapuna (Unless Sold Prior)\r\n\r\nElevated and north facing on a half share of 963sqm (more or less), this light-filled family home offers sunshine, privacy and a fantastic lifestyle in the heart of Browns Bay. Ideally located close to Browns Bay Village, local parks, shops and excellent schools, it's a home that's ready for your family to move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nThe bright open plan living and dining area is filled with natural light and opens through bifold doors to a wraparound deck, creating a seamless space for entertaining and everyday family living. A second deck at the rear, fully fenced grounds and a sandpit provide even more room for children, pets and outdoor enjoyment.\r\n\r\n**Key Features**\r\n* Half share of 963sqm (more or less) with an elevated, north-facing position and pleasant outlook\r\n* Four bedrooms, including a separate downstairs bedroom ideal for teenagers, guests or working from home\r\n* Modern kitchen with open plan dining and a modernised family bathroom\r\n* Light-filled living opening through bifold doors to a wraparound entertaining deck\r\n* Second rear deck, fully fenced outdoor area and sandpit, perfect for children and pets\r\n* Four heat pumps providing year-round comfort\r\n* Large windows with double glazing enhancing natural light and comfort\r\n* Internal access single garage with laundry, plus two off-street parking spaces\r\n* Walking distance to Browns Bay Village, local parks, shops and public transport\r\n* Zoned for Torbay School, Sherwood School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College\r\n\r\nWhether you're searching for your first family home, extra space for a growing family or a home in sought-after school zones, this well-presented property is ready for its next chapter. Contact us today to arrange your viewing.\r\n\r\nWe work with all agencies from Day 1.",
